{"title":"Christmas Ribbons","description":"\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eExplore Decorative Ribbon for Christmas Trees and Holiday Décor\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eExplore our decorative Christmas ribbon to add the perfect finishing touch to your holiday décor. With a wide range of colors, textures, and finishes, our ribbon collection is designed to complement your \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/artificial-christmas-trees\" title=\"Artificial Christmas Tree\"\u003eartificial Christmas tree\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e, wreaths, garlands, and gift wrapping with ease.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhether you're creating statement bows, layering ribbon throughout your tree, or adding detail to a wreath or garland, decorative ribbon offers a simple way to elevate your overall holiday design.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRibbon Styles \u0026amp; Finishes\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eOur Christmas ribbon collection includes a variety of styles to suit both traditional and modern décor. Traditional options like \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"/\/products\/red-thick-ribbon\" title=\"Red Thick Ribbon\"\u003eclassic red ribbon\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e and \u003ca href=\"/\/products\/red-thin-ribbon\" title=\"Classic Thin Red Ribbon\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eclassic thin red ribbon\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e bring a timeless holiday feel, while \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"/\/products\/royal-green-ribbon\" title=\"Royal Green Ribbon\"\u003eroyal green ribbon\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e adds rich, seasonal color.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eFor added texture and dimension, styles such as gold mesh ribbon and netted stretch ribbon create a layered, designer look. If you’re looking to incorporate shimmer and light, options like gold glitter ribbon, white glitter ribbon, simple silver ribbon, and champagne ribbon introduce subtle shine and elegance. For a more decorative, seasonal detail, forest snowflake ribbon adds a winter-inspired accent.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eEach ribbon is offered in 10-yard lengths with wired edges, making it easy to shape bows, wrap garlands, decorate trees, or style wreaths with precision and consistency.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncorporating Ribbon Into Your Holiday Décor\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eChristmas ribbon is one of the most versatile decorating elements, allowing you to tie together your entire holiday display. Use it to create cascading layers within your unlit or pre-lit Christmas tree, weave it through our decorative garlands along staircases or mantels, or add structure and detail to your Christmas \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/artificial-christmas-wreaths\" title=\"Artificial Christmas Wreaths\"\u003ewreaths\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eRibbon is especially effective when decorating \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/sparse-artificial-christmas-trees\" title=\"Sparse Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003esparse artificial Christmas trees\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e, where the open branch design allows ribbon to fill space, add dimension, and create a more styled, intentional look. It’s also a simple way to elevate smaller displays, such as accent Christmas trees like the Windsor collection, where adding bows or ribbon detailing can enhance the overall presentation without overwhelming the design.\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eFrom classic and traditional styles to more modern and decorative finishes, our Christmas ribbon from Carol's Christmas Conifers makes it easy to add depth, texture, and a polished finish to your holiday décor. Explore our collection to find the styles that best complement your space and bring your holiday vision together.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"champagne-ribbon","title":"Champagne Ribbon (10 yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on your centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths, accessorizing gift\n\u003cbr\u003eboxes, or seeking to add a quick splash of Holiday elegance to that space that needs just a bit more, a little ribbon can go a long way. Our elegant Champagne Ribbon offers the perfect neutral coloring that will complement any color theme in style. 10 yards in length, the decorating possibilities are truly endless. Upgrade your décor arsenal today with a roll of the distinguished Champagne Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42345649373384,"sku":"RB-CHAMP","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/ChampagneRibbon_10yards.jpg?v=1714662888"},{"product_id":"netted-ribbon","title":"Netted Stretch Ribbon (10 yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eYour must-have décor is here. Whether you’re putting the finishing touches on your centerpiece, wrapping your\n\u003cbr\u003ewreaths, accessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick splash of Holiday elegance to that space that needs just a bit more, a little ribbon can go a long way. Our sparkling Netted Ribbon offers that final touch that will instantly complement any color theme in style. 10 yards in length, the decorating possibilities are truly endless. Upgrade your décor arsenal today with a roll of versatile Netted Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42345660481736,"sku":"RB-NETTED","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/NettedStretchRibbon_10yards.jpg?v=1714674628"},{"product_id":"silver-ribbon","title":"Simple Silver Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eLooking for the ideal way to give your holiday\n\u003cbr\u003edecorations the traditional touch they deserve?\n\u003cbr\u003eLook no further than our Classic Silver Ribbon. With\n\u003cbr\u003estunning hue of shimmering silver, this ribbon is\n\u003cbr\u003eguaranteed to instantly elevate any holiday setting.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eClassic Silver Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037285064,"sku":"CEF6J8Q","price":39.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/P1020097copy.png?v=1714674766"},{"product_id":"red-thick-ribbon","title":"Classic Red Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eCreating a memorable holiday atmosphere with\n\u003cbr\u003eyour loved ones is easy with the Classic Red\n\u003cbr\u003eRibbon. This timeless ribbon is the perfect way to\n\u003cbr\u003ecomplement your decorations for an unforgettable\n\u003cbr\u003eChristmas, season after season. Accented with\n\u003cbr\u003eexquisite gold trim to create a timeless flair, this\n\u003cbr\u003etradition-worthy ribbon will add the perfect touch\n\u003cbr\u003eof elegance to your oasis.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eClassic Red Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037317832,"sku":"JGJ2C4J","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/ClassicRedRibbon.png?v=1714662241"},{"product_id":"red-thin-ribbon","title":"Classic Thin Red Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eTalk about a timeless tradition that will never go\n\u003cbr\u003eout of style. Red ribbon has been a staple of every\n\u003cbr\u003eholiday oasis for decades. Our Classic Red Thin\n\u003cbr\u003eRibbon takes it to the next level, perfectly\n\u003cbr\u003ecomplementing your setting with a splash of red\n\u003cbr\u003ethat is accented with an elegant gold trim.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eClassic Red Thin Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037350600,"sku":"VEV5K8F","price":39.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/ClassicThinRedRibbon.png?v=1714662232"},{"product_id":"royal-green-ribbon","title":"Royal Green Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Royal Green Ribbon is a holiday must-have that\n\u003cbr\u003eadds a majestic touch to your Christmas décor. This\n\u003cbr\u003eelegant ribbon features unique gold accents that\n\u003cbr\u003ewill make your holiday oasis sparkle and shine\n\u003cbr\u003ebrighter than ever before while adding a timeless\n\u003cbr\u003etradition to your seasonal celebrations that will\n\u003cbr\u003ecreate warm memories for years to come.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eRoyal Green Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037383368,"sku":"LCV9S2E","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/1_0b9f2410-cdbe-4ce4-8695-49444202caa8.jpg?v=1718159242"},{"product_id":"gold-glitter-ribbon","title":"Gold Glitter Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the spirit of the holidays into your home with\n\u003cbr\u003eGold Glitter Ribbon from Carol's Christmas Conifers. Made\n\u003cbr\u003ewith sparkling glitter accents, this elegant gold\n\u003cbr\u003eribbon exudes a festive sheen and is perfect for\n\u003cbr\u003ethat traditional Christmas setting that will instill\n\u003cbr\u003ethe best memories season after season.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eGold Glitter Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037448904,"sku":"FNM3S2J","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/P1020184copy.png?v=1714674770"},{"product_id":"white-glitter-ribbon","title":"White Glitter Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eA perfect way to add some sparkle to your\n\u003cbr\u003echerished holiday traditions, our White Glitter\n\u003cbr\u003eRibbon was designed to make your festivities\n\u003cbr\u003emagical, merry, and memorable. Carefully crafted\n\u003cbr\u003ewith the perfect balance of glitter, this alluring\n\u003cbr\u003eribbon adds that distinct touch of holiday cheer\n\u003cbr\u003eyou’ve been looking for.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eWhite Glitter Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037481672,"sku":"KWN2M2Y","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/P1010820copy.png?v=1714674753"},{"product_id":"gold-mesh-ribbon","title":"Gold Mesh Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eDetails matter when it comes to creating a\n\u003cbr\u003ememorable Christmas setting. And what better way\n\u003cbr\u003eto dress up your holiday décor than with our\n\u003cbr\u003edistinctively designed Gold Mesh Ribbon. This\n\u003cbr\u003eelegant and unique ribbon offers a mesh effect that\n\u003cbr\u003eadds an extra touch of detail to your oasis, creating\n\u003cbr\u003ea glowing ambiance that your family and guests will\n\u003cbr\u003etruly appreciate.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eGold Mesh Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037514440,"sku":"DQB3F6S","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/GoldMeshRibbon.png?v=1714671309"},{"product_id":"snowflake-ribbon","title":"Forest Snowflake Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWelcome to your holiday oasis. Our Forest\n\u003cbr\u003eSnowflake Ribbon is your perfect companion in\n\u003cbr\u003ecreating a festive scene that resembles a true\n\u003cbr\u003eholiday wonderland. With its intricately designed\n\u003cbr\u003etexture and sparkling snowflakes that hint at winter\n\u003cbr\u003emagic and festive cheer, this unique ribbon is a\n\u003cbr\u003emust-have for true Christmas enthusiasts!\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eForest Snowflake Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037547208,"sku":"XGQ7N6X","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/ForestSnowflakeRibbon_10Yards.png?v=1714671221"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/Christmas_Ribbon.png?v=1761586326","url":"/\/collections\/ribbons.oembed","provider":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","version":"1.0","type":"link"}